%% MediCircle — C4 Level 1 System Context
%% Five-sided India healthcare platform. India-sovereign hosting, no hyperscaler.
%% Mermaid rules: no parentheses/commas inside node text or edge labels; short labels.
flowchart TB
    %% ---- Actors (the five sides) ----
    PAT[Patient<br/>mobile app]
    DOC[Doctor or Hospital<br/>web and mobile]
    LAB[Diagnostic Center<br/>lab staff edge counter]
    PHA[Pharmacy<br/>web portal]
    CARE[Home-Care Professional<br/>care-pro app]
    ADMIN[Platform Admin<br/>web console]

    %% ---- The platform ----
    MC{{MediCircle Platform<br/>hybrid edge plus cloud<br/>lab microservices plus connective monolith}}

    %% ---- Actor edges ----
    PAT -->|books tests meds visits| MC
    DOC -->|referrals e-prescriptions teleconsult| MC
    LAB -->|orders results reports offline| MC
    PHA -->|fulfilment delivery inventory| MC
    CARE -->|availability visits check-in| MC
    ADMIN -->|operations and moderation| MC

    %% ---- External integrations (sovereign-aligned) ----
    RZP[Razorpay<br/>payments and payouts]
    WA[WhatsApp<br/>Gupshup or Meta]
    SMS[MSG91<br/>SMS DLT]
    FCM[FCM<br/>push]
    MAIL[Resend<br/>email]
    VID[100ms<br/>video teleconsult]
    AI[Anthropic Claude<br/>assistive cues]
    OCR[Sovereign OCR<br/>report parsing]
    ABDM[ABDM and ABHA<br/>FHIR R4 records]
    MAPS[Maps<br/>Google or OLA geo]

    MC -->|checkout webhooks payouts| RZP
    MC -->|templated messages| WA
    MC -->|otp and alerts| SMS
    MC -->|device push| FCM
    MC -->|transactional email| MAIL
    MC -->|rooms and tokens| VID
    MC -->|structured prompts no raw PHI| AI
    MC -->|async pdf parse| OCR
    MC -->|consent-driven exchange| ABDM
    MC -->|geocode and routing| MAPS

